# Card art

Prefer the **orange ROUNDS blob** (round orange body, stubby limbs, simple black face) as the actor or victim. Kickback, Shove, Thief, TASER, and Fumble are the look to match.

## Style

- Solid black background. One huge centered action filling most of the frame.
- Thick **cream sticker outline** around the whole subject, thick black inner outlines, flat cel colors.
- **No text** on the PNG (no title, punchline, stats, or "50%"). The card UI already shows those.
- Limited palette. Keep it readable at a glance.

## Files

Every card and curse needs both:

- `MulliganMadness/Art/{name}.png` at **1100x865** (Cover-fit into pick cards)
- `MulliganMadness/Art/{name}_mini.png` at **512x512** (one simplified symbol for the top-right card bar)

`{name}` is lowercase, no spaces (same string as `CardArtFactory.Create("name")`). Copy both into `package/Art/` on build. Minis are applied automatically by `CardBarMiniIcons` when `{name}_mini.png` exists.

## New cards

Generate full 4:3 art plus a 1:1 mini in this style. Do not ship a card with missing art or letters-only bar icons.
